      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60283c7c4c9a9639a694c668|full_name}: This is a feature of UdonSharp, it is not built into the normal SDK. This appears to be working normally on open beta the same as it does in live. Make sure that you have udonsharp installed and \"Listen for client exceptions\" enabled in project settings > udonsharp.",
