      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: Yeah, it was turned on. However, it turns out that for some reason in Unity 2019, the Output Log Watch Mode (located right below that checkmark) was disabled by default. So, I manually switched that back to \"All Logs\" and it's working again.",
